⚡️🇦🇷🇬🇧 President Javier Milei ordered the start of an international arbitration procedure against the United Kingdom under the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea (UNCLOS) to halt the “Sea Lion” hydrocarbon exploitation project in the Falkland Islands.

The Argentine Government demanded that the United Kingdom suspend the activities within two weeks, under warning that it would request provisional measures before the International Tribunal for the Law of the Sea.

