⚡🇪🇺 Energy Commissioner Dan Jorgensen urges the 27 Member States to adopt measures to reduce gas and electricity demand for the time necessary to address the price crisis linked to supply. 

In a letter to ministers, he emphasizes: "Reducing demand can help contain prices."

@medmannews

⚡🇮🇹🇮🇶Italy has fully withdrawn its forces from Iraq, ending a 12-year mission. 

Defense Minister Crosetto confirmed the departure of the last personnel and logistical materials, concluding operations focused on combating Daesh, ensuring security, and training Iraqi and Kurdish forces.

